{
 "about": "Which API fields each analysis tab of the web console renders, read from apps/web/src: the header, then the six tabs (Overview, Behaviour, Network, Static & code, Indicators & detection, Evidence). A path is '<root>:<dotted path>', '[]' walking a list. Roots: report = GET /api/v1/reports/job/{job_id}, job = GET /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}, stix = GET /api/v1/reports/{report_id}/stix, evidence = GET /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}/evidence, events = GET /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}/events, follow_ups = GET /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}/follow-ups, call_map = GET /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}/evidence/call-map. 'limit' is how many list entries the tab draws; 'hidden_if_section' names section keys whose content makes the tab draw the section instead of the field. Sections (report:malware_report.sections[]) are placed by 'section_routing' and drawn by 'section_body'.",
